        },
        {
          "text": "oo shan ulood oo kalena wuxuu u sameeyey looxyada dhinaca kale kaga jira taambuugga, oo shan ulood oo kalena wuxuu u sameeyey looxyada taambuugga kaga jira xaggiisa dambe oo galbeed xigta. ",
