        {
          "text": "Oo looxyadii wuxuu ku dahaadhay dahab, oo siddooyinkoodana wuxuu ka sameeyey dahab inay ahaadaan meelihii ay ulaha gudban ka geli lahaayeen, oo ulihiina wuxuu ku dahaadhay dahab.",
